# Shared state tree (offchain/state/<network>_run_<id>/) used by the CLI and the
# feeder. The CLI's deployment record — config-bootstrap.json, clients/*.json,
# intents/, config-updates/, update-batches/ — is committed. The feeder's runtime
# output below is generated at run time and not committed.
*/logs/
*/feeder-checkpoint.json
*/clients/*/pairs/
*/feeder.sqlite
*/feeder.sqlite-journal
*/feeder.sqlite-shm
*/feeder.sqlite-wal
